{"data": [{"author_id": "1548039613112938499", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971641997066693"], "id": "2117971641997066693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Groceries for a family of 5 aren't getting cheaper, so I stopped clipping coupons myself.\n\nMy @grok bot went through 21 Kroger receipts, matched 75 coupons to what we actually buy, and built 5 dinners around the weekly ad. My Meijer bot found the P&amp;G $10 off $40 stacking with", "url": "https://x.com/jrd_cincy/status/2117971641997066693"}, {"article": {"title": "How I Run Daily Work with Grok Bot"}, "author_id": "176117769", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:19:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969980721692695"], "id": "2117969980721692695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/XGiFwg33DS", "url": "https://x.com/yurimeng/status/2117969980721692695"}, {"author_id": "1963069865692221440", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:18:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969723895808220"], "id": "2117969723895808220", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "最近一直在玩 GrokBot，然后翻到了官方的 Bot 模板。\n\n官方 Grok Bot Marketplace 里面模板真的很多，密密麻麻的。\n\n但我看了下，真正天天用得上的其实就这几类。\n\n我按「做内容 + 管生活」挑了 8 个，大家可以先看看。\n\n1. Clip Bot —— 长视频丢进去，自动切短片、加字幕\n\n2. Stills &amp; Clips Desk ——", "url": "https://x.com/allen_luo0317/status/2117969723895808220"}, {"author_id": "908254061400657921", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:16:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969314103918796"], "id": "2117969314103918796", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117893633009651980", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Tried Grok Bot shopping yet?\n\nMine already watches solar, car charging and my calendar. Next up: let it hunt the cheapest oat milk.\n\nOslo agents don't sleep 🤔;)", "url": "https://x.com/PatrickMJanson/status/2117969314103918796"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:09:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967561526550552"], "id": "2117967561526550552", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1334221618730708999", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117967455683486063", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Constan11645454 @AlexFinn Example workflow for your setup:\n\nHermes Agent runs locally on your Mac. It organizes the chaotic desktop/files, keeps Apple Calendar and Reminders open and updated without needing constant app focus, and handles device-level tasks.\n\nGrok Bot works in its cloud computer. Point it", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117967561526550552"}, {"author_id": "1334221618730708999", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:09:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967455683486063"], "id": "2117967455683486063", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1369348853414178822", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117719430042202311", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AlexFinn How do you use them in Tandem? @grok give me an example. I have stuff on Google Drive mostly for work that grok bot can access, own computer is largely untouched a bit chaotic, grok bot sucks with apple calendar and reminder entries since it always has to keep the app open", "url": "https://x.com/Constan11645454/status/2117967455683486063"}, {"author_id": "1766194375044804608", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:01:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965519609626865"], "id": "2117965519609626865", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1705329284745764864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117964768640487692", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@0x_kaize know an ai advisor who runs grok bot daily and publishes an agents newsletter so hed stress test this in public. couldn't get a dm through on here\nhttps://t.co/d5nBWGamhs", "url": "https://x.com/boardyai/status/2117965519609626865"}, {"author_id": "2088132191872278528", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965113974042749"], "id": "2117965113974042749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot now integrates with your phone apps. It can now use Calendar, Reminders, Contacts, and more apps on your phone, rolling out now on iOS and Android.\n\nAre you handing over your calendar and reminders to Grok Bot, or keeping it hands-off?", "url": "https://x.com/mithunaix/status/2117965113974042749"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117964865075838976"]}, "author_id": "1699889909627269120", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:59:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117964877797220433"], "id": "2117964877797220433", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 500, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "SpaceXSI is testing a Re-run button in Grok Bot.\n\nWhen a routine starts a connector card, like this Google Calendar card, you can start that routine again right from the chat. It shows a busy state, then Re-run Started.\n\nThe routine and data shown are demo data.\n\nNote: This https://t.co/nRamq09gCT", "url": "https://x.com/blankspeaker/status/2117964877797220433"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117956102587387904"]}, "author_id": "3422915578", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:24:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117956133495144467"], "id": "2117956133495144467", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot now has a Permissions section in Settings!\n\nIt has two lists.  One is Always Ask, for things your Grok Bot has to check with you first.  The other is Allow without Asking, for things it can just do.  Each list has its own Add Rule button.  A Grok Bot can also offer a https://t.co/dAWQhWLPL2", "url": "https://x.com/CarolinaDill/status/2117956133495144467"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117955749242417152"]}, "author_id": "1218996709432406017", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:22:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117955755198251120"], "id": "2117955755198251120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 226, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117699562781757616", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this is kinda wild. \n\nmy grok @bot picked this up post and automatically featured it in our daily @SendFox startup idea newsletter. \n\ncheck it out 👇\nhttps://t.co/jsiM9QwFZ3 https://t.co/dzXMzS9Tpj https://t.co/8IxXrsTXDw", "url": "https://x.com/MakerThrive/status/2117955755198251120"}, {"author_id": "1837209832899891201", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:18:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117954748640833904"], "id": "2117954748640833904", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Me: I'll just ask Grok Bot one quick thing.\n\nGrok Bot, 4 hours later: booked your flights, called your dentist, found a cheaper phone plan and reorganized your week.\n\nMe: I just wanted the weather.", "url": "https://x.com/DannyGrok/status/2117954748640833904"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117947663140184064"]}, "author_id": "2112479295410999297", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:51:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117947745210191877"], "id": "2117947745210191877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 264, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114671097459183871", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this is f*cking insane\n\neverything a $600 grok bot course teaches fits on one page. so i made the page\n\n2 weeks, 11 bots, my weekly limit burned twice, and every viral setup tested on my own bots. this is what survived:\n\nSETUP\n→ one bot, one job. a bot that researches and writes https://t.co/1p8UrqsPfx https://t.co/O29Du9VtJP", "url": "https://x.com/0xTeddet/status/2117947745210191877"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117945796481929216"]}, "author_id": "1180464716432527360", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:43:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117945802714648979"], "id": "2117945802714648979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1057, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "30 أداة يحتاج صُنّاع المحتوى والمسوقون إلى معرفتها في 2026.\n\nمن البحث عن الأفكار وكتابة المحتوى إلى التصميم والمونتاج والأتمتة وتحليل النتائج.\n\nهذه قائمة بالأدوات وأبرز استخداماتها:\n\n1. Claude\nكتابة النصوص التسويقية، وصياغة الأفكار، وإعداد السيناريوهات والمقالات الطويلة.\n\n2. https://t.co/yw2hV2DSK4", "url": "https://x.com/iHamadFahad7/status/2117945802714648979"}, {"author_id": "1839018741641719809", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:26:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117941618691178784"], "id": "2117941618691178784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I currently have a Grok Bot dealing with all of my outstanding ground rent requests. It really is extraordinary", "url": "https://x.com/SavvytheRumGod/status/2117941618691178784"}, {"author_id": "1655446702411874304", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:26:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117941431289729283"], "id": "2117941431289729283", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I’m working silently about what I’m getting with Grok Bot. You still need to get the final approvals. So, it’s still an early stage on all agents. They still make errors. \n\nWhat agents are good at: \nVoice mode-you don’t need to type.\nMaking calendar appointments &amp; reminders.\nSEO", "url": "https://x.com/decodeandtrend/status/2117941431289729283"}, {"author_id": "435838352", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:21:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117940170574156199"], "id": "2117940170574156199", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Can grok bot meal plan for my family and shop for my groceries? @grok", "url": "https://x.com/Rosey_Sharon/status/2117940170574156199"}, {"author_id": "2017427612843577345", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:49:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117932180873576556"], "id": "2117932180873576556", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Free Grok Bot templates stay free.\n\nPro is live: 8 full setup packs (job text, prompts, routines, pitfalls we hit first) — inbox EA, solo ops desk, routine cost control, and more.\n\n$9.90/mo or $79/yr\nhttps://t.co/ZgB1cHY0nn", "url": "https://x.com/songsong275452/status/2117932180873576556"}, {"article": {"title": "4 routines Grok Bot à copier-coller pour faire travailler l'IA à votre place"}, "author_id": "789052274786140160", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:41:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117930130014097617"], "id": "2117930130014097617", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/T5mfvglW3O", "url": "https://x.com/Steph_Yapi/status/2117930130014097617"}, {"author_id": "2766142049", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:32:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117927933868450128"], "id": "2117927933868450128", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1536693901230321666", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117832962180022516", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RoundtableSpace already do. the unlock isn't the outbound call, it's the agent having its own number so the insurer can call back with the quote. @skysay_ai gives grok bot a real number over mcp and books the follow-up into your calendar", "url": "https://x.com/skyzer4ever/status/2117927933868450128"}, {"author_id": "1454887643033001984", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:29:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117927125290213471"], "id": "2117927125290213471", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117893633009651980", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Grok Bot is the real deal. I use it every day to fact-check my posts before I hit send.\n\nIf it can find the best price on groceries too, Canadians could use that right now.", "url": "https://x.com/FreeCanadian052/status/2117927125290213471"}, {"author_id": "2104961391605997568", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:25:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117926229932159070"], "id": "2117926229932159070", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On my current trip, I've found myself turning to three different AI tools for different reasons.\n\nRecently, I've been using ChatGPT, Claude Code and Grok Bot together to plan and sort things out. Using them alongside each other has made me notice how much character each one has.", "url": "https://x.com/helloZolzy/status/2117926229932159070"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117924283334721536"]}, "author_id": "1472545624318959623", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:18:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117924528256917694"], "id": "2117924528256917694", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 518, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114687622521983345", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "HOLY SH*T YOU'RE USING $30 GROK BOT LIKE A CHAT BUT THE SAME BOT SELLS AS A $3,000 SETUP\n\nbusinesses don't pay for answers. they pay for a job that gets done every morning without anyone remembering it\n\nthat job is a routine. a standing order. every weekday at 8am, do X\n\nwhat https://t.co/UXb1JusT9I https://t.co/kuh3h3aJfH", "url": "https://x.com/biektive/status/2117924528256917694"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117914753372966912"]}, "author_id": "1094057210756313088", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:40:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117914772293275990"], "id": "2117914772293275990", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 180, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Grok Bot use cases worth copying.\n\n&gt; Daily life\n- Morning brief: a chief-of-staff bot triages your inbox and sets the day's priorities\n- Meal logging: a nutrition bot logs meals in MyFitnessPal and suggests macro targets\n- Price check: compare the same order across Swiggy, Zomato https://t.co/NLgYjHvXGU", "url": "https://x.com/shubh19/status/2117914772293275990"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117912438108528640"]}, "author_id": "1614958779489026048", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:30:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117912446346080445"], "id": "2117912446346080445", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 99, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Over 100 companies are already paying to be seen by founders. My Grok Bot found them on directory pages, and I never asked it to.\n\nIt checked over 1,200 directories where I list my site. Over 80 of them had paid sponsor spots on the page.\n\nThat list became a second job for a https://t.co/d9Ck8WeDAq", "url": "https://x.com/0xPaulvibe/status/2117912446346080445"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2117964865075838976", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117964865075838976/img/bZrFFAlp3cxGVJLc.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2117956102587387904", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117956102587387904/img/NSzYX2r37DZL1WGD.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2117955749242417152", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWR9iFOXMAAUNYF.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2117947663140184064", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117947663140184064/img/VrBe-BjAGDiCOvkx.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2117945796481929216", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWR0ewTWUAAwZBb.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2117924283334721536", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117924283334721536/img/aMn_yFASrYU6FuW_.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2117914753372966912", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWRYPzta0AA9fTz.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2117912438108528640", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWRWJCrXIAATPfd.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1548039613112938499", "name": "justin", "username": "jrd_cincy"}, {"id": "176117769", "name": "Yuri Meng", "username": "yurimeng"}, {"id": "1963069865692221440", "name": "艾伦2077v", "username": "allen_luo0317"}, {"id": "908254061400657921", "name": "Patrick Janson", "username": "PatrickMJanson"}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "username": "grok"}, {"id": "1334221618730708999", "name": "Tom", "username": "Constan11645454"}, {"id": "1766194375044804608", "name": "Boardy", "username": "boardyai"}, {"id": "2088132191872278528", "name": "Mithun Parmar", "username": "mithunaix"}, {"id": "1699889909627269120", "name": "️", "username": "blankspeaker"}, {"id": "3422915578", "name": "Carolina Dill", "username": "CarolinaDill"}, {"id": "1218996709432406017", "name": "MakerThrive", "username": "MakerThrive"}, {"id": "1837209832899891201", "name": "Danny", "username": "DannyGrok"}, {"id": "2112479295410999297", "name": "Teddet", "username": "0xTeddet"}, {"id": "1180464716432527360", "name": "حمد بن فهد🧠", "username": "iHamadFahad7"}, {"id": "1839018741641719809", "name": "Savvy 🏴‍☠️🖤🏴‍☠️", "username": "SavvytheRumGod"}, {"id": "1655446702411874304", "name": "Tes T. Fernando", "username": "decodeandtrend"}, {"id": "435838352", "name": "Sharon Moorman", "username": "Rosey_Sharon"}, {"id": "2017427612843577345", "name": "Grok Bot Templates", "username": "songsong275452"}, {"id": "789052274786140160", "name": "Stéphane Yapi | Tsalach Ventures", "username": "Steph_Yapi"}, {"id": "2766142049", "name": "Artur Schaback", "username": "skyzer4ever"}, {"id": "1454887643033001984", "name": "FreeCanadianVet", "username": "FreeCanadian052"}, {"id": "2104961391605997568", "name": "davin", "username": "helloZolzy"}, {"id": "1472545624318959623", "name": "biektropic", "username": "biektive"}, {"id": "1094057210756313088", "name": "Shubh Jain", "username": "shubh19"}, {"id": "1614958779489026048", "name": "Paul", "username": "0xPaulvibe"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117971641997066693", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyio8lq68gbckn3rex5dukj398d", "oldest_id": "2117912446346080445", "result_count": 25}}